Privacy Policy - https://read-control.com/privacy.html

epubReader iOS is a ePub book reader，It support almost all css style to provide you with a great reading experience.User can easily manage private ebook library.
Current fuctions:
   * Support iPhone5;
   * Supports ePub format e-book , perfect supports all css styles, support for vertical reading;
   * Support playing audio and video content in the ePub e-books;
   * Supports custom reading background image/color and text color;
   * Supports bookmarks, notes function;
   * Supports StarDict format dictionary;
   * Built-in online catalog, supports showing the download progress;
   * Reading record synchronization, multi-device synchronization read;
   * Supports import epub books from iTunes;
   * Supports custom font display, supports multi-font ePub formate e-book reading (user can import ttf fonts  through iTunes);
    * Supports transmit files（epub、ttf、dictionary files) through WiFi;
    * User can select UI language;
